ll stable if you are alone."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["This is the tenth year that I have left my hometown Caiyun Mountains, probably."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Originally, there were some divine beasts that came down to earth living in that place."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["In the past, I worked with Boss Lu in order to \"enter the world of the world\"."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Although it is a job, in addition to the occasional special customers, the store will be"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["There are only miscellaneous tasks such as cleaning and transporting goods."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The food is good every day, and there are also big chicken legs occasionally."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Take your friends out for a trip, and there will be roasted lizards and grasshopper snacks."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["How happy and comfortable--just"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["…………"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["partner? Who is it? I can't remember their names at all."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It's strange that life there is vivid in my mind."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But it is very vague about the divine beasts."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It was as if something deliberately wiped them out of my mind."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Just lived happily for a few years, suddenly one day"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Well—What the hell happened? Forgot."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["All I can remember is a sea of ​​fire and the wounded boss Deer."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["He handed me a sword and the mask he had been wearing."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[13,"swordandmask",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[13,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,60,true]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,2]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":[" "]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[13]},{"code":222,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["What is his name? What did he say? What does he look like?"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["What exactly happened?"]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I don't know, and I don't want to know either."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I escaped and never went back."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I once suspected that life in the store was a long dream."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["The swords placed in the study and the masks locked in the cabinet."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["This is true."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Recently, the symptoms of amnesia have become increasingly obvious."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I often forget what I did the day before yesterday."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Even dreaming of a cage."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I'm so scared and anxious."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I had to use sleeping pills to force my sleep."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I started writing a diary, trying to keep myself awake."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["By the way, a big boss has recently arrived in the store."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["He is quite generous in his actions."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["It seems to be a god in the capital, called \"Rabbit Master\"."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["That's great, when will I reach the top..."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["He said my store had a \"familiarity\"."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I can remember \"a friend in my memory\"."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["..."]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["Maybe we really met before."]},{"code":101,"indent":0,"parameters":["",0,2,1]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["But if that blank memory is involved-"]},{"code":401,"indent":0,"parameters":["I decided not to cause trouble."]},{"code":231,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,"FourLeafClover",0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0]},{"code":232,"indent":0,"parameters":[1,0,0,0,0,0,100,100,255,0,180,true]},{"code":230,"indent":0,"parameters":[180]},{"code":242,"indent":0,"parameters":[5]},{"code":221,"indent":0,"parameters":[]},{"code":235,"indent":0,"parameters":[1]},{"code":201,"indent":0,"parameters":[0,2,15,5,4,0]},{"code":356,"indent":0,"parameters":["Lightmask_Opacity 0"]},{"code":121,"indent":0,"parameters":[27,27,0]},{"code":123,"indent":0,"parameters":["A",0]},{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0,"stepAnime":false,"through":false,"trigger":3,"walkAnime":true},{"conditions":{"actorId":1,"actorValid":false,"itemId":1,"itemValid":false,"selfSwitchCh":"A","selfSwitchValid":true,"switch1Id":1,"switch1Valid":false,"switch2Id":1,"switch2Valid":false,"variableId":1,"variableValid":false,"variableValue":0},"directionFix":false,"image":{"characterIndex":0,"characterName":"","direction":2,"pattern":0,"tileId":0},"list":[{"code":0,"indent":0,"parameters":[]}],"moveFrequency":3,"moveRoute":{"list":[{"code":0,"parameters":[]}],"repeat":true,"skippable":false,"wait":false},"moveSpeed":3,"moveType":0,"priorityType":0